description=Runtime CPU overclock via the MTK cpuhvfs debug hook (phyclk/phyvolt) and GPU overclock via gpufreqv2, for Redmi Note 14 4G (tanzanite, MT6789). Nothing is written to any partition - a reboot always returns to stock.
